    <!-- ==================== MAIN ==================== -->
    <main>
        <div class="intro-callout" id="overview">
            <p>👋 <strong>Welcome.</strong> This is a complete, self-contained path from <em>"what is a container?"</em> to <strong>CKA-certified administrator</strong> — and the real-world operations beyond the exam. You never need another doc, blog, book, or video.</p>
            <p>Everything is taught on one real app, <strong>easypj</strong> (a Django <em>jobpost</em> project on PostgreSQL): you'll containerize it, deploy it, scale it, secure it, break it, fix it, and ship it. Aligned 100% to the <strong>official 2025 CKA syllabus</strong>. Use the <strong>☰ sidebar</strong> to jump anywhere.</p>
        </div>

