            </div>

            <p>If you ever feel lost later, come back to this map — every advanced topic (etcd, RBAC, networking, troubleshooting) is just a deeper look at one of these six ideas. Here's the same arc as a quick-reference table:</p>
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr><th>Section</th><th>Answers the question…</th><th>One-line takeaway</th></tr>
                </thead>
