                    <li>1. Create a service <code>web-svc</code> in namespace <code>prod</code></li>
                    <li>2. From a test pod, resolve: <code>nslookup web-svc.prod.svc.cluster.local</code></li>
                    <li>3. Verify short name works within same namespace: <code>nslookup web-svc</code></li>
                    <li>4. Edit CoreDNS Corefile to add a custom rewrite rule</li>
                    <li>5. Verify CoreDNS config reload: <code>kubectl logs -n kube-system -l k8s-app=kube-dns | grep reload</code></li>
